{"id":"17-2745-2-7","zh":"在被动语态中：anubhūyataṃ tayā（愿由你来体验），anubhūyantaṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2745-8-11","zh":"anubhūyassu，anubhūyavho。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2745-12-15","zh":"anubhūye，anubhūyāmase。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2745-16-20","zh":"作为为他词（parassapada）时：anubhūyyatu，anubhūyyantu。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2745-21-28","zh":"anubhūyatu，或者 anubhūyantu，anubhūyyāhi 等等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2745-29-31","zh":"表动作本身（bhāva）时：bhūyataṃ。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2746-2-10","zh":"表命令时，在主动语态中：devadatto dāni odanaṃ pacatu（现在让天授煮饭吧），pacantu。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2746-11-16","zh":"paca，pacāhi，pacatha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2746-17-20","zh":"pacāmi，pacāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2746-21-24","zh":"pacataṃ，pacantaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2746-25-28","zh":"pacassu，pacavho。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2746-29-32","zh":"pace，pacāmase。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2747-2-11","zh":"在被动语态中，加 ya 词缀并作 c 类同化等：paccataṃ odano devadattena（愿饭由天授来煮），paccantaṃ。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2747-12-15","zh":"paccassu，paccavho。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2747-16-19","zh":"pacce，paccāmase。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2747-20-24","zh":"作为为他词时：paccatu，paccantu。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2747-25-30","zh":"pacca，paccāhi，paccatha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2747-31-34","zh":"paccāmi，paccāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2748-2-9","zh":"同样：so gāmaṃ gacchatu（让他到村子去吧），gacchantu。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2748-10-15","zh":"gaccha，gacchāhi，gacchatha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2748-16-19","zh":"gacchāmi，gacchāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2748-20-23","zh":"gametu，gamentu。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2748-24-29","zh":"gama，gamāhi，gametha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2748-30-33","zh":"gamemi，gamema。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2748-34-37","zh":"gacchataṃ，gacchantaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2748-38-41","zh":"gacchassu，gacchavho。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2748-42-45","zh":"gacche，gacchāmase。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2748-46-52","zh":"替换为 ghamma 时：ghammatu，ghammantu 等等。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2749-2-15","zh":"在被动语态中：gacchīyataṃ，gacchīyatu，gamīyataṃ，gamīyatu，gammataṃ，gammatu 等等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2750-2-11","zh":"表规定（vidhi）时：idha pabbato hotu（让这里有一座山），ayaṃ pāsādo suvaṇṇamayo hotu（让这座宫殿成为金造的）等等。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2751-2-12","zh":"表邀请时：adhivāsetu me bhante bhagavā bhojanaṃ（尊者，请世尊接受我的饮食供养），idha nisīdatu bhavaṃ（请您坐在这里）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2752-2-7","zh":"表请求时：desetu bhante bhagavā dhammaṃ（尊者，请世尊说法）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2753-2-12","zh":"表允许时：pucchatu bhavaṃ pañhaṃ（您可以提问），pavisatu bhavaṃ（您可以进来），ettha nisīdatu（可以坐在这里）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2754-2-14","zh":"祈愿就是乞求：dadāhi me gāmavarāni pañca（请给我五个上等的村庄），ekaṃ me nayanaṃ dehi（请给我一只眼睛）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2755-2-12","zh":"表时机已到时：sampatto te kālo kaṭakaraṇe（你编草席的时候到了），kaṭaṃ karotu bhavaṃ（请您编草席）等等。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2756-2-3","zh":"第五语尾（命令式）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2757-2-21","zh":"453. 第七语尾是：eyya、eyyuṃ，eyyāsi、eyyātha，eyyāmi、eyyāma，etha、eraṃ，etho、eyyāvho，eyyaṃ、eyyāmhe。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2758-2-7","zh":"eyya 等十二个语尾称为第七语尾（sattamī）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2759-2-9","zh":"前条的“在未说明的时间”（anuttakāle）一语延续到这里适用。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2760-2-8","zh":"454. 表允许与假设之义时，用第七语尾。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2761-2-10","zh":"在表允许之义与假设之义时，于未说明的时间用第七语尾。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2762-2-8","zh":"由于用了“义”（attha）一词，表规定、邀请等义时也用第七语尾。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2762-9-33","zh":"对想要做某事的他人予以准许，就是“允许”（anumati）；设想就是“假设”（parikappa），即像“假如会是这样”那样的考察与推断，以及在因行为可能发生时，对果行为也可能发生的设想。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-2763-2-24","zh":"其中，在表假设时，第七语尾为他词第一人称（paṭhamapurisa，相当于第三人称）单数是 eyya；加 a 词缀、元音增强等与前面相同；依“kvaci dhātu vibhattī”等规则，eyya、eyyāsi、eyyāmi、eyyaṃ 这几个语尾可以选择性地替换为 e。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-2763-25-47","zh":"so dāni kiṃ nu kho bhave（他现在会怎样呢）；yadi so paṭhamavaye pabbajeyya, arahā bhaveyya（如果他在青年时出家，就会成为阿罗汉）；sace saṅkhārā niccā bhaveyyuṃ, na nirujjheyyuṃ（如果诸行是常住的，就不会灭去）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2763-48-54","zh":"yadi tvaṃ bhaveyyāsi（如果你会成为……），tumhe bhaveyyātha。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2763-55-64","zh":"kathamahaṃ devo bhaveyyāmi（我要怎样才能成为天神呢），kiṃ nu kho mayaṃ bhaveyyāma（我们会怎样呢）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2763-65-69","zh":"同样：bhavetha，bhaveraṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2763-70-73","zh":"bhavetho，bhaveyyāvho。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2764-2-12","zh":"表祈愿时则是：ahaṃ sukhī bhave（愿我快乐），buddho bhaveyyaṃ（愿我成佛），bhaveyyāmhe。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2765-2-8","zh":"在被动语态中：sukhaṃ tayā anubhūyetha（快乐会被你体验到），anubhūyeraṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2765-9-12","zh":"anubhūyetho，anubhūyeyyāvho。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2765-13-18","zh":"anubhūye，anubhūyeyyaṃ，anubhūyeyyāmhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2765-19-23","zh":"作为为他词时：anubhūyeyya，anubhūyeyyuṃ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2765-24-26","zh":"anubhūyeyyāsi 等等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2765-27-29","zh":"表动作本身时：bhūyetha。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-2766-2-10","zh":"表规定时：so odanaṃ pace（他应当煮饭），paceyya，paceyyuṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-2766-11-18","zh":"tvaṃ pace，paceyyāsi，tumhe paceyyātha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2766-19-26","zh":"ahaṃ pace，paceyyāmi，mayaṃ paceyyāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2766-27-30","zh":"pacetha，paceraṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2766-31-34","zh":"pacetho，paceyyāvho。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2766-35-40","zh":"pace，paceyyaṃ，paceyyāmhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2767-2-7","zh":"在被动语态中：paccetha，pacceraṃ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2767-8-11","zh":"paccetho，pacceyyāvho。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2767-12-17","zh":"pacce，pacceyyaṃ，pacceyyāmhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2767-18-24","zh":"作为为他词时：pacce，pacceyya，pacceyyuṃ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2767-25-27","zh":"pacceyyāsi 等等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2768-2-24","zh":"表允许时：so gāmaṃ gacche（他可以到村子去），gaccheyya；依“kvaci dhātū”等规则，eyyu 可以选择性地替换为 uṃ：gacchuṃ，gaccheyyuṃ。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-2768-25-31","zh":"tvaṃ gacche，gaccheyyāsi，gaccheyyātha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2768-32-37","zh":"gacche，gaccheyyāmi，gaccheyyāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2768-38-45","zh":"game，gameyya，gamuṃ，gameyyuṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2768-46-51","zh":"game，gameyyāsi，gameyyātha。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2768-52-57","zh":"game，gameyyāmi，gameyyāma。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2768-58-61","zh":"gacchetha，gaccheraṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2768-62-65","zh":"gacchetho，gaccheyyāvho。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2768-66-71","zh":"gacche，gaccheyyaṃ，gaccheyyāmhe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2768-72-76","zh":"gametha，gameraṃ 等等。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-2769-2-11","zh":"在被动语态中：gacchīyetha，gamīyetha，gacchīyeraṃ，gamīyeraṃ 等等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2769-12-21","zh":"作为为他词时：gacchīyeyya，gamīyeyya，gammeyya，gammeyyuṃ 等等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-2769-22-29","zh":"同样：ghamme，ghammeyya，ghammeyyuṃ 等等。","confidence":85}
